      "tests": [
        "tests/test_privacy_restore.py::test_same_lineage_restore_applies_current_ledger_before_recovery",
        "tests/test_privacy_restore_continuity.py::test_restore_ignores_a_checkpoint_copied_from_a_newer_export"
      ],
      "note": "Current ledger applied before serving, including a forged artifact checkpoint. The snapshot-only case is the missing and foreign ledger refusals in test_same_lineage_restore_applies_current_ledger_before_recovery: the checkpoint serialized in the snapshot is not accepted as authority, restore and native open are refused, and no native copy is served. Rolling back both a snapshot and its independent ledger is outside the claim."
    }
  },
  "backend_independent": {
    "EM01": "Fixed AES-256-GCM CAVP vectors, a whole-envelope vector and independent-library decryption run on the crypto module alone; no storage backend is opened.",
    "EM06": "Local public writer, grant, lease, expiry and audit ordering are custody and capability logic in the privacy runtime; the tests open no storage backend. Stored-evidence diagnostic reads on PostgreSQL are covered by AC02 (test_EM03_real_ciphertext_storage_and_private_diagnostic).",
    "AC05": "Envelope tamper, key loss and audit-time denial are crypto, custody and audit logic; the mapped tests open no storage backend. The PostgreSQL stored-evidence read path is covered by AC02."
  },
  "adapter_subchecks_rule": "Each listed adapter of a case needs mapped tests that ran and all passed, on at least one backend; the gate names the backends. async_python is the async engine API that the case's own mapped tests drive. kind 'refusal' marks an adapter that does not support the protected operation and refuses it before side effects with a fixed code; the gate reports it as proven by refusal, not as a positive pass. The LangChain and LlamaIndex chat-history adapters refuse every protected write (privacy_unsupported_input); their retrieval adapters are positive in AC08. The ordinary CLI cannot supply a privacy runtime, so its reads refuse to open a protected store.",
